#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: wow-map.php
msgid "WOW Map"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: wow-map.php
msgid "A small OpenStreetMap map as a block. The picture is drawn once on this server and stored here, so a visitor never makes a request to anybody else."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
#: wow-map.php
msgid "Wow-arts"
msgstr ""

